            0.797
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) A rubber sucker (M) is pressed on a flat smooth surface and an identical sucker (N) is pressed on a rough surface:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
